Relevant columns and how they will be used  
• `Year` : filter the two comparison years (2012‑01‑01 and 2017‑01‑01)  
• `GeoFIPS` : keep the county FIPS in the final output  
• `GeoName` : restrict the study to Massachusetts counties (ends with “, MA”) and display user‑friendly names  
• `Earnings_per_job_avg` : the metric whose change (2017 – 2012) we need to calculate  

Typical conditions that will be used  
1. `WHERE GeoName LIKE '%, MA'` – pick only Massachusetts counties.  
2. `WHERE Year IN ('2012-01-01','2017-01-01')` – retain the two target years.  

